{
  "schemaVersion": "1.1.0",
  "id": "grafana-table-signal-workbench",
  "title": "Signal workbench: advanced table techniques",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Start in **Dashboards** and build a standalone table with synthetic signals, readable rows, summary calculations, and numeric gauges."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "open-your-visualization-workspace",
      "title": "Open your visualization workspace",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/dashboards",
          "requirements": [],
          "id": "step-1",
          "tooltip": "Begin the independent build from this workspace.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Open Dashboards to begin with a saved workspace.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have opened the starting workspace for an independent dashboard build."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Prepare **TestData** if it is missing; an existing source skips this setup, while creating one requires an administrator on Cloud or OSS."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "prepare-testdata-once",
      "title": "Prepare TestData once",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "prepare-testdata-once-setup-testdata",
          "content": "Create and test the synthetic source.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "navigate",
              "reftarget": "/connections/datasources/new",
              "requirements": [],
              "id": "step-2",
              "tooltip": "Prepare a synthetic source only when one is missing.",
              "description": "Open the shared Add data source page.",
              "skippable": true
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.AddDataSource.searchInput}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/connections/datasources"
              ],
              "targetvalue": "TestData",
              "id": "step-3",
              "tooltip": "No external credentials are needed for this practice data.",
              "description": "Find TestData; no external service or credentials are needed. Set the value to TestData.",
              "skippable": true
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "body:has({grafana:pages.AddDataSource.searchInput}) button:text('TestData')",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/connections/datasources"
              ],
              "id": "step-4",
              "tooltip": "Create a local source of synthetic samples.",
              "description": "Create the TestData source.",
              "skippable": true
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:pages.DataSource.saveAndTest}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/connections/datasources"
              ],
              "id": "step-5",
              "tooltip": "Confirm the synthetic source is ready to query.",
              "description": "Check that the synthetic source works.",
              "skippable": true
            }
          ],
          "skippable": true
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "is-admin"
      ],
      "objectives": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have a synthetic source to practice with without external services or credentials."
    },
    {
      "type": "conditional",
      "id": "practice-source-ready",
      "conditions": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ],
      "whenTrue": [
        {
          "type": "input",
          "id": "choose-practice-source",
          "inputType": "datasource",
          "variableName": "practiceSource",
          "datasourceFilter": "grafana-testdata-datasource",
          "prompt": "Select your TestData source; its name may differ in your organization.",
          "required": true,
          "requirements": [
            "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "whenFalse": []
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Create a fresh dashboard, connect your selected source, and name a **Table** panel."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "build-the-table-panel",
      "title": "Build the Table panel",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/dashboard/new",
          "requirements": [],
          "id": "step-6",
          "tooltip": "Start with a fresh workspace for this lab.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Create a fresh dashboard for this lab.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Sidebar.newPanelButton}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "id": "step-7",
          "tooltip": "Create space for the synthetic signals.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Add a panel for your synthetic signals.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Sidebar.configurePanelButton}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "id": "step-8",
          "tooltip": "Adjust the query and presentation together.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Open the visualization editor.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSourcePicker.inputV2}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "{{practiceSource}}",
          "id": "step-9",
          "tooltip": "Use the source selected in this guide.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Use the TestData source you selected. Set the value to {{practiceSource}}.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "build-the-table-panel-viz",
          "content": "Choose the **Table** visualization.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.Tab.title:Visualizations}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "id": "step-10",
              "tooltip": "Choose how to display the returned samples.",
              "description": "Open the visualization chooser."
            },
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PluginVisualization.item:Table}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "id": "step-11",
              "tooltip": "Display samples as rows and columns.",
              "description": "Select Table."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldInput:Title}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "Signal workbench",
          "id": "step-12",
          "tooltip": "Make the finished panel easy to recognize.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Give the panel a recognizable name. Set the value to Signal workbench.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have a named panel connected to the source chosen for this sitting."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Generate one random walk from 50 within a range of 0 to 100 so you can focus on reading the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "create-bounded-practice-signals",
      "title": "Create bounded practice signals",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSource.TestData.QueryTab.min}:is(input)",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "0",
          "id": "step-13",
          "tooltip": "Keep the generated values nonnegative.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Keep the synthetic values at or above zero. Set the value to 0.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSource.TestData.QueryTab.max}:is(input)",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "100",
          "id": "step-14",
          "tooltip": "Keep the generated values within the practice range.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Cap the synthetic values at 100. Set the value to 100.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSource.TestData.QueryTab.startValue}:is(input)",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "50",
          "id": "step-15",
          "tooltip": "Begin halfway between the two bounds.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Start the random walk halfway through the range. Set the value to 50.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.DataSource.TestData.QueryTab.seriesCount}:is(input)",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "1",
          "id": "step-16",
          "tooltip": "Keep the exercise focused on one numeric field.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Generate 1 synthetic signal. Set the value to 1.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.RefreshPicker.runButtonV2}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "id": "step-17",
          "tooltip": "Load samples using the configured range.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Run the query to see your practice data.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have bounded synthetic samples for comparing display settings without interpreting them as real service health."
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "id": "knowledge-check-3",
      "question": "What do the generated values tell you?",
      "completionMode": "correct-only",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "1",
          "text": "They provide practice data for interpreting visual settings.",
          "correct": true,
          "hint": "The random walk is synthetic and bounded for this exercise."
        },
        {
          "id": "2",
          "text": "They measure the health of a real service.",
          "correct": false,
          "hint": "No production service was queried."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Adjust row spacing, column layout, pagination, filters, and decimal display to make the table easier to scan."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "make-a-dense-table-readable",
      "title": "Make a dense table readable",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table Frozen columns} input",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "1",
          "id": "step-18",
          "tooltip": "Keep timestamps visible during horizontal scrolling.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Keep the timestamp visible while scrolling horizontally. Set the value to 1.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table Cell height} input[title='Medium']",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true",
          "id": "step-19",
          "tooltip": "Give rows more breathing room.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Give rows more breathing room.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table Minimum column width} input",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "140",
          "id": "step-20",
          "tooltip": "Reserve enough horizontal space to scan each column.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Reserve enough width for readable columns. Set the value to 140.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table Wrap header text} input[type='checkbox']",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true",
          "id": "step-21",
          "tooltip": "Let long headings use more than one line.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Allow long column headings to wrap.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table Enable pagination} input[type='checkbox']",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true",
          "id": "step-22",
          "tooltip": "Split loaded rows into pages without limiting the query.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Divide the loaded rows into pages; this does not limit the query.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table Column filter} input[type='checkbox']",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true",
          "id": "step-23",
          "tooltip": "Allow readers to narrow visible values by column.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Enable interactive column filters.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Standard options Decimals} input",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "1",
          "id": "step-24",
          "tooltip": "Round the display without changing the underlying samples.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Display one decimal without changing the underlying values. Set the value to 1.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have separated table readability settings from query limits and underlying numeric precision."
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "id": "knowledge-check-4",
      "question": "What changes when pagination is enabled?",
      "completionMode": "correct-only",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "1",
          "text": "Loaded rows are divided into pages.",
          "correct": true,
          "hint": "Pagination controls presentation; it does not limit the query."
        },
        {
          "id": "2",
          "text": "The data source returns fewer samples.",
          "correct": false,
          "hint": "Query limits and page layout are separate concerns."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Add **Mean** and **Max** to the footer and enable inspection of truncated cell values."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "summarize-and-inspect-values",
      "title": "Summarize and inspect values",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table footer Calculation} input",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "Mean",
          "id": "step-25",
          "tooltip": "Summarize the average of the numeric samples.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Add Mean to summarize the numeric samples. Set the value to Mean.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Table footer Calculation} input",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "Max",
          "id": "step-26",
          "tooltip": "Compare the peak against the average.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Also add Max to compare the peak with the mean. Set the value to Max.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:Cell options Cell value inspect} input[type='checkbox']",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true",
          "id": "step-27",
          "tooltip": "Allow access to contents when the displayed value is truncated.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Enable inspecting cell contents when a displayed value is truncated.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have paired average and peak summaries with access to cell contents that may be truncated."
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "id": "knowledge-check-5",
      "question": "Why keep both Mean and Max in the footer?",
      "completionMode": "correct-only",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "1",
          "text": "To compare the average sample with the peak.",
          "correct": true,
          "hint": "The two summaries describe different aspects of the numeric samples."
        },
        {
          "id": "2",
          "text": "To replace every sample with one rounded value.",
          "correct": false,
          "hint": "Footer calculations summarize samples; decimal formatting affects display."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Apply a field override to **A-series** so numeric values become gradient gauges while **Time** retains its time display."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "turn-one-numeric-column-into-gauges",
      "title": "Turn one numeric column into gauges",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "turn-one-numeric-column-into-gauges-matcher",
          "content": "Match only **A-series**.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.ValuePicker.button:Add field override}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "id": "step-28",
              "tooltip": "Scope presentation changes to a specific field.",
              "description": "Create an override for the signal column."
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.ValuePicker.select:Add field override} input",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "targetvalue": "Fields with name",
              "id": "step-29",
              "tooltip": "Match the field using its displayed name.",
              "description": "Choose a field by its name. Set the value to Fields with name."
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.OptionsPane.fieldLabel:panel-options-override-0 Fields with name} input",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "targetvalue": "A-series",
              "id": "step-30",
              "tooltip": "Leave timestamps outside this numeric override.",
              "description": "Match only the numeric signal, leaving Time alone. Set the value to A-series."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "turn-one-numeric-column-into-gauges-property",
          "content": "Add the cell type override.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.ValuePicker.button:Add override property}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "id": "step-31",
              "tooltip": "Choose which presentation setting to override.",
              "description": "Add a cell presentation override."
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.ValuePicker.select:Add override property} input",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "targetvalue": "Cell options > Cell type",
              "id": "step-32",
              "tooltip": "Configure how each matching value is rendered.",
              "description": "Choose the cell type property. Set the value to Cell options > Cell type."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "action": "formfill",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.OptionsGroup.group:panel-options-override-0} input[role='combobox']:not([id='panel-options-override-0-matcher'])",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetvalue": "Gauge",
          "id": "step-33",
          "tooltip": "Use bar length to help compare numeric samples.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Render values as inline gauges. Set the value to Gauge.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.OptionsGroup.group:panel-options-override-0} input[title='Gradient']",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "targetstate": "true",
          "id": "step-34",
          "tooltip": "Use a continuous fill to compare lengths.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Use a gradient fill to compare gauge lengths.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.PanelEditor.General.content}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "id": "step-35",
          "tooltip": "Automatic bounds reflect the automatically chosen display range rather than percent capacity.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Compare gauges with the footer; automatic gauge bounds represent the automatically chosen display range, not percent capacity.",
          "doIt": false,
          "showMe": true
        }
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "has-datasource:grafana-testdata-datasource"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You have scoped a visual encoding to one numeric field and learned that automatic gauge bounds show the automatically chosen display range."
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "id": "knowledge-check-6",
      "question": "Does a full automatically scaled gauge mean 100% capacity?",
      "completionMode": "correct-only",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "1",
          "text": "No, automatic bounds represent the automatically chosen display range.",
          "correct": true,
          "hint": "These synthetic values do not describe capacity."
        },
        {
          "id": "2",
          "text": "Yes, its length always measures capacity.",
          "correct": false,
          "hint": "The gauge bounds have not been defined as a capacity scale."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Save the finished dashboard under a recognizable name and inspect the retained table configuration."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "keep-your-finished-dashboard",
      "title": "Keep your finished dashboard",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "{grafana:components.NavToolbar.editDashboard.backToDashboardButton}",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/dashboard/new"
          ],
          "id": "step-36",
          "tooltip": "Return with the panel configuration ready to save.",
          "type": "interactive",
          "content": "Return to the dashboard.",
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "type": "multistep",
          "id": "keep-your-finished-dashboard-save",
          "content": "Save the dashboard as Table lab - Signal workbench.",
          "steps": [
            {
              "action": "highlight",
              "reftarget": "{grafana:components.NavToolbar.editDashboard.saveButton}",
              "requirements": [
                "exists-reftarget",
                "on-page:/dashboard/new"
              ],
              "id": "step-37",
              "tooltip": "Keep the next three actions together while the drawer is open.",
              "description": "Open the save drawer."
            },
            {
              "action": "formfill",
